  "question": {
    "text": "The set of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#950;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#950;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
